//   u (x): cos(theta_view) in [0,1]     v (y): sheen roughness alpha in [0,1]
//   texel = (aInv, bInv, R, 1)  with  mInv = [[aInv,0,bInv],[0,aInv,0],[0,0,1]]
// and R the directional reflectance (multiple scattering included) — R rises
